direction: right

s3_jitter: S3 抖动 {class: hot}
part_unreadable: part 读不到 {class: base}
query_hang: 查询 hang {class: base}
merge_stuck: 后台 merge 卡住 {class: base}
write_bp: 写入背压 {class: base}
restart: "restart 起不来\n(要重新 stat 所有 S3 part)" {class: hot}
hot_dead: 热数据查询也跟着挂 {class: hot}

s3_jitter -> part_unreadable -> query_hang -> merge_stuck -> write_bp
query_hang -> restart -> hot_dead
